  "thesis": "A VIX close above the same-date VIX3M close represents acute short-horizon equity stress relative to the three-month expectation. Holding BTC only when the lagged VIX/VIX3M ratio is at or below one may avoid uncompensated cross-asset stress paths and improve drawdown and Calmar after costs while preserving sufficient BTC upside.",
  "economic_rationale": "The policy is valuable only if a public and observable equity-volatility term structure improves matched-capital BTC economics beyond passive holding after normal and doubled friction. Positive aggregate PnL is insufficient: Design, Validation, annual breadth, concentration, drawdown, Calmar, upside capture, terminal inventory sensitivity and both neighboring ratios must support the mechanism.",
